Hi,

this previous change [1] to mold made it BD-Uninstallable on architectures where
clang is not available. Since those build dependencies are optional according to
the commit message, clang should be added to Build-Depends on only on architectures
where its available.

The attached patch fixes this.

Thanks,
Adrian

